#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. A massage parlor. -> T0.P17 | 2. A hot spring. -> T0.P32 | 3. A gentleman's club. -> T0.P22 | 4. A video store. -> T0.P27
msgctxt "324_Tanimura"
msgid "Well, you could be talking about a..."
msgstr "Bueno, podrías estar hablando de..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "336_Tanimura"
msgid "Let's go to Love in Heart. Maybe that's the kind of place\\r\nyou're looking for."
msgstr "Vamos a Love in Heart. Tal vez ese sea el tipo de lugar\\r\nque estás buscando."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Smith
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=A massage parlor.
msgctxt "348_Smith"
msgid "You sure you're not just pulling something out of your ass?"
msgstr "¿Estás seguro de que no te estás sacando algo del culo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=A massage parlor.
msgctxt "360_Tanimura"
msgid "You worry too much. Just follow me."
msgstr "Te preocupas demasiado. Solo sígueme."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Smith
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=A massage parlor.
msgctxt "372_Smith"
msgid "Oh... Okay. I guess I'll give it a try."
msgstr "Oh... Bien. Supongo que lo intentaré."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=A gentleman's club.
msgctxt "396_Tanimura"
msgid "I know this place called Asia. We should go there."
msgstr "Conozco este lugar llamado Asia. Deberíamos ir allí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Smith
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=A gentleman's club.
msgctxt "408_Smith"
msgid "What's it all about?"
msgstr "¿De qué se trata?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Tanimura"
msgid "Well, it's a gentlemen's club. There's nothing quite like\\r\ncrowding around a sweaty stage that inspires camaraderie\\r\namong men. It's a very primal way of bonding, if you ask me."
msgstr "Bueno, es un club de caballeros. No hay nada como\\r\nApiñarse alrededor de un escenario sudoroso que inspira camaradería\\r\nentre los hombres. Es una forma muy primitiva de vincularse, si me preguntas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_Smith"
msgid "Right, that sense of masculine solidarity! Sounds like you\\r\nhit the nail on the head with this one. Let's hop to it!"
msgstr "¡Cierto, ese sentido de solidaridad masculina! Parece que\\r\nhas dado en el clavo. ¡Vamos a ello!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=27
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P27
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
#. y4:msg_choice_index=4
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=A video store.
msgctxt "456_Tanimura"
msgid "Let's go to Beam."
msgstr "Vayamos al Beam."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=28
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P28
#. y4:msg_speaker=Smith
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=4
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=A video store.
msgctxt "468_Smith"
msgid "\"Beam\"? Sounds a little suspect to me..."
msgstr "¿Beam? Suena un poco sospechoso..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "480_Tanimura"
msgid "It's a video store stocked with everything you could\\r\npossibly imagine, and more. I have a feeling it'll have\\r\nthose \"men only\" and \"communication\" elements you're after."
msgstr "Es un videoclub lleno de todo lo que puedas\\r\nposiblemente imaginar, y más. Tengo la sensación de que tendrá\\r\nesos elementos de \"solo hombres\" y \"comunicación\" que buscas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "492_Smith"
msgid "Hmm, you sound like you know what you're talking about.\\r\nOkay, then I look forward to seeing it. Let's try it out!"
msgstr "Hmm, parece que sabes de lo que estás hablando.\\r\nEstá bien, entonces espero con ansias verlo. ¡Vamos a probarlo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
